  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 708.13 Access to Equipment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 708.13 Access to Equipment.\n\n(a) Suitable openings, hatches, or other means shall be provided for removal of machinery and equipment.\n\n(b) Openings shall be large enough to allow for removal of the largest piece of equipment or largest component if equipment is disassembled.\n\n(c) Lifting devices, properly sized for the required loads, shall be provided for removal of equipment.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 700) #8590, eff 3-25-06; ss by #10693, eff 10-15-14; ss by #14258, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
